      "type": "mechanism",
      "text": "Chaga mushroom is rich in antioxidants such as melanin, betulinic acid, and polyphenols. These compounds help reduce oxidative stress and modulate inflammatory signaling pathways. Chaga also appears to influence immune cell activity, potentially balancing Th1/Th2 immune responses. Its adaptogenic properties may support stress resilience through HPA-axis modulation."
